WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.479
In Settings › Profiles, each part of life has a profile of its own.

2
00:00:03.479 --> 00:00:05.879
Opening “Work” opens a window of its own, with its own colour and name.

3
00:00:05.879 --> 00:00:09.079
“Work” keeps its history, logins and cookies apart from “Personal”.
